          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "在 B 连接的命令窗口输入 start transaction;，并更新相应记录，但不提交："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "update test1 set name='张三丰' where id = 1;"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "在 A 连接中查询表："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> select * from test1;\n+----+-----------+-----+\n| id | name      | age |\n+----+-----------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰    |  20 |\n|  2 | 李四      |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五      |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六      |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六      |  26 |\n+----+-----------+-----+\n5 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "结果：在 B 连接开始事务、更新数据、没有提交的情况下，A 连接可以在 read-uncommitted 模式下查询到 B 连接未提交的数据 —— 脏读复现。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B 连接窗口输入 rollback 回滚数据，此时 A、B 连接所查询的数据，和初始时的数据是一样的。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.4 不可重复读复现（READ COMMITTED）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "54-不可重复读复现read-committed"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "创建 A 连接，并设置当前事务模式为 Read Committed："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> set transaction_isolation = 'read-committed';\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "A 连接查询表 test1 的所有记录（启动事务，查询到初始 5 行数据，输出同初始数据，略）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B 连接启动事务，更新字段（不提交）："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> update test1 set name='张三丰' where id = 1;\nQuery OK, 1 row affected (0.01 sec)\nRows matched: 1  Changed: 1  Warnings: 0"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "回到 A 连接再次执行查询，并未查询到 B 连接没有提交的更新，解决了脏读的问题（输出同初始数据，略）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B 连接提交事务："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> commit;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.01 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "返回 A 连接查询，可以看到 B 连接已提交的更新，但结果与上一步不一致，即产生了不可重复读的问题："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> select * from test1;\n+----+--------+-----+\n| id | name   | age |\n+----+--------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰 |  20 |\n|  2 | 李四   |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五   |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六   |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六   |  26 |\n+----+--------+-----+\n5 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.5 可重复读复现（REPEATABLE READ + MVCC）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "55-可重复读复现repeatable-read-mvcc"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "打开 A 连接，设置当前事务模式为 repeatable-read，查询表 test1 的所有记录："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> set transaction_isolation = 'repeatable-read';\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> select * from test1;\n+----+--------+-----+\n| id | name   | age |\n+----+--------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰 |  20 |\n|  2 | 李四   |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五   |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六   |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六   |  26 |\n+----+--------+-----+\n5 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "在客户端 A 的事务提交之前，打开另一个客户端 B，更新表 test1 并提交："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> update test1 set age = age + 3 where id = 1;\nQuery OK, 1 row affected (0.00 sec)\nRows matched: 1  Changed: 1  Warnings: 0\n\nmysql> commit;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "回到 A 连接再次查询 test1 表，没有出现不可重复读的情况，结果与第一步一致（输出同第 1 步，略）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "接着在 A 连接执行更新操作 update test1 set age = age + 2 where id = 1; 时，age 并没有更新为 20+2=22，而是根据第 2 步中已经提交的 23 + 2 = 25 来计算的："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> update test1 set age = age + 2 where id = 1;\nQuery OK, 1 row affected (0.00 sec)\nRows matched: 1  Changed: 1  Warnings: 0\n\nmysql> select * from test1;\n+----+-----------+-----+\n| id | name      | age |\n+----+-----------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰    |  25 |\n|  2 | 李四      |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五      |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六      |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六      |  26 |\n+----+-----------+-----+\n5 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "原理：数据的一致性没有被破坏，是因为可重复读的隔离级别下使用了 MVCC 机制："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "select 操作不更新版本号，是快照读（历史版本）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "insert、update、delete 会更新版本号，是当前读（当前版本）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "5.6 幻读复现（REPEATABLE READ）与 Serializable 演示"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "56-幻读复现repeatable-read与-serializable-演示"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "打开 A 连接设置隔离级别为 repeatable-read，查询表 test1 的所有记录（此时已有 5 行，输出同 5.5 第 1 步，略）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "打开 B 连接插入一条数据并提交："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> insert into test1 (name, age) values ('王二麻子',20);\nQuery OK, 1 row affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> commit;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "回到 A 连接中查询，却没有查询到新增的数据（快照读不受影响）；提交后再次查询才查询到新增的数据："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> select * from test1;   -- 仍只有 5 行（略）\nmysql> select * from test1;   -- 仍只有 5 行（略）\n\nmysql> commit;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> select * from test1;\n+----+--------------+-----+\n| id | name         | age |\n+----+--------------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰       |  25 |\n|  2 | 李四         |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五         |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六         |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六         |  26 |\n|  6 | 王二麻子     |  20 |\n+----+--------------+-----+\n6 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "补充说明：实验证明在 MySQL REPEATABLE READ 下，快照读（普通 select）通过 MVCC 看不到其他事务新插入的行，从而避免了幻读；但如果是当前读（如 select ... for update、update、insert），仍可能产生幻读，InnoDB 通过 next-key 锁（间隙锁） 来防御。MySQL 8.0 起还引入了 SELECT ... FOR UPDATE 配合 NOWAIT/SKIP LOCKED 等能力，详见官方文档。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "A 连接设置事务隔离级别为 serializable，启动事务并查询："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> set transaction_isolation = 'serializable';\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> select * from test1;\n+----+--------------+-----+\n| id | name         | age |\n+----+--------------+-----+\n|  1 | 张三丰       |  25 |\n|  2 | 李四         |  22 |\n|  3 | 王五         |  24 |\n|  4 | 赵六         |  26 |\n|  5 | 赵六         |  26 |\n|  6 | 王二麻子     |  20 |\n+----+--------------+-----+\n6 rows in set (0.00 sec)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B 连接启动事务新增一条数据，但执行时该命令已处于阻塞状态，直到 A 连接事务提交后，该条命令才解除阻塞："
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mysql> start transaction;\nQuery OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)\n\nmysql> insert into test1 (name, age) values ('王三麻子',20);\n-- 这里没有提示运行成功，保持阻塞状态\nQuery OK, 1 row affected (18.47 sec)\n-- 直到 A 连接事务提交后该命令才执行成功，该命令运行了 18.47 秒"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "结论：因为 set transaction_isolation = 'serializable'; 让事务保持串行化，因此不会出现幻读的情况；但这种隔离级别并发性极低，开发中很少会用到。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "参考文献"
